== MRB constant C = sum (-1)^n (n^(1/n) - 1)
  C (Euler-Boole) = 0.1878596424620671202485179340542732300559
  |C - OEIS A037077 digits| = 3.4e-52
  C = sqrt2 - 1 - sum_k [f(r_(2k+1)) - f(r_(2k+2))] is the FTC form of the PDF's integral over E: check at 30 digits:
  first five interval terms via f(r_n) and via f(n) agree: |diff| = 1.56e-61
